OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo batters Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of homes across
OL,7,FScotland remain without power in the
OL,8,Faftermath of Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FA 60-year-old man died as the second
OL,11,Fnamed storm in a matter of days brought
OL,12,Fheavy flooding and wind gusts in some
OL,13,Fareas of up to 85mph (137km/h).
OL,15,FRichard Baines, the long-serving
OL,16,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden near
OL,17,FStranraer, is understood to have been
OL,18,Fwalking near his home in Mid Kelton,
OL,19,Fjust outside Castle Douglas, when he
OL,20,Fwas hit by a falling tree.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
